n through the browser tool failed because the browser access host is unavailable. The definition and generated HTML source were inspected, but layout, readability and successful browser rendering remain unverified."],"advice":["Add explicit proposed test cases for execution settling before admission resolves and admission remaining unresolved through cleanup. Assert terminal evidence is retained within a bounded reservation, late active updates are discarded, and legacy settlement remains independent.","Consider carrying the routed-only relay qualification and independent legacy delivery semantics into generated diagram notes or branches; the current generated arrows omit the explanatory descriptions retained in the canonical definition."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"incomplete","summary":"All 39 inventory units have inspection coverage across the completed substantive chunks. The current LLD aligns with S2 acceptance criteria, upstream ownership boundaries, measurement semantics and legacy compatibility requirements. No additional cross-chunk defects were demonstrated. Mandatory sequence-rendering verification remains incomplete.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/task-progress-workflow-analysis-s2-lld.json",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-206db3426ffd4428-s2.json","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md: constraints k1–k8 and S2 ac1–ac2","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md: architecture, sc1–sc4, story boundaries and rollout","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md: section 2.1 producer admission, sequencing and terminal evidence","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/sequence-diagram.html: generated sequence source and rendering bootstrap","src/daemon/task-progress/runtime.ts: recovery and owner-probe scheduling","src/daemon/workflow-rpc.ts: WorkflowProgress and provider delta callbacks","src/daemon/workflow-run-registry.ts: detached execution, settlement, polling and abort","src/daemon/analyze-rpc.ts: terminal result shaping and progress emission","src/daemon/threads/method-class.ts: workflow and analysis routing",".insrc/tmp/design-review/task-progress-workflow-analysis-s2-lld.json: accepted contracts, adapters and lifecycle feedback; inventory coverage reconciliation"],"limitations":["Actual visual verification of docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/sequence-diagram.html remains incomplete. The accepted lifecycle feedback records browser access-host failure. Definition and generated HTML source were inspected, but successful rendering, layout and readability were not verified."],"advice":["Retain the completed chunks’ suggestions for a concrete mapping table, durable citation c1, explicit generic constraint and additional admission-race fixtures; these are optional improvements, not demonstrated blockers.","Complete browser inspection of the generated S2 sequence companion before closing the review."]}],"limitations":["Actual visual verification of docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/sequence-diagram.html was unavailable: opening the companion through the browser tool failed because the browser access host is unavailable. The definition and generated HTML source were inspected, but layout, readability and successful browser rendering remain unverified.","Actual visual verification of docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/sequence-diagram.html remains incomplete. The accepted lifecycle feedback records browser access-host failure. Definition and generated HTML source were inspected, but successful rendering, layout and readability were not verified."],"reviewer":"daemon","reviewedContentId