n through the browser tool failed because the browser access host is unavailable. The definition and generated HTML source were inspected, but layout, readability and successful browser rendering remain unverified."],"advice":["Add explicit proposed test cases for execution settling before admission resolves and admission remaining unresolved through cleanup. Assert terminal evidence is retained within a bounded reservation, late active updates are discarded, and legacy settlement remains independent.","Consider carrying the routed-only relay qualification and independent legacy delivery semantics into generated diagram notes or branches; the current generated arrows omit the explanatory descriptions retained in the canonical definition."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"incomplete","summary":"All 39 inventory units have inspection coverage across the completed substantive chunks. The current LLD aligns with S2 acceptance criteria, upstream ownership boundaries, measurement semantics and legacy compatibility requirements. No additional cross-chunk defects were demonstrated. Mandatory sequence-rendering verification remains incomplete.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/task-progress-workflow-analysis-s2-lld.json",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-206db3426ffd4428-s2.json","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/DEF.md: constraints k1–k8 and S2 ac1–ac2","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/HLD.md: architecture, sc1–sc4, story boundaries and rollout","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S001/LLD.md: section 2.1 producer admission, sequencing and terminal evidence","docs/epics/show-long-running-task-progress-chat-E20261109206db342/S002/sequence-diagram.html: generated sequence source and rendering bo